	(descr "HOAUC HYCW236-USBA04-289B USB-A 2.0 receptacle, mid-mount in a board cutout (1.2 mm PCB), IPX8 gasket. Land per HOAUC drawing: pads 1.30 wide (4 3 2 1 at -3.5 / -1.0 / +1.0 / +3.5, shell at +-6.4), plated slots 0.6 x 1.7 at x = +-8.05 (y = 4.63, measured), cutout 14.90 wide to y = 2.5 then 14.40 wide to the board edge at y = 8.28, R0.5 reliefs at (+-7.45, 6.83). Deviation: signal/shell pads end 0.3 mm short of the cutout edge (JLC copper-to-edge rule); HOAUC pads reach the edge. The cutout is drawn on Dwgs.User here and cut into Edge.Cuts by the board generator.")
